[Event "vs Sicilian: Wing Gambit 2.b4"]
[Opening "Sicilian Defense"]
[Side "White"]
[Check "gambit"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 c5 2. b4 {The Wing Gambit: give the b-pawn to pull Black's c-pawn away from the center. Risky – the engine says Black is better – but fun!} cxb4 3. a3 d5 {The best answer: hit back in the center.} 4. exd5 Qxd5 5. Nf3 e5 6. axb4 Bxb4 7. c3 Be7 8. d4 {Open lines while Black's queen is in the middle.} *
